HHIISSTTOORRYY
       ppaammccuutt was derived from ppnnmmccuutt in Netpbm 9.20 (May 2001).  It  was  the
       first  Netpbm program adapted to the new PAM format and programming li‐
       brary.

       The predecessor ppnnmmccuutt was one of the oldest tools in the Netpbm  pack‐
       age.



